# Default plan for Run-BZRModeStress.ps1 (Docs/RELEASE_QUALIFICATION.md,
# "Mode-transition stress (unattended)"). Grammar: include/mode_stress_plan.h.
#
#   mission <file.bzn> <seconds> [campaign]   campaign-mode load
#   ia <file.bzn> <seconds>                   Instant Action load
#   mp_host <file.bzn> <seconds>              host a one-player LAN game in this process
#   shell <seconds>                           idle on the main menu
#   loop <n>                                  run the whole list n times
#
# <seconds> counts from "ready" (the mission sim loop running). Every load
# returns to the main menu before the next step. The CR missions need Campaign
# Reimagined (Workshop 3686673790) installed (campaign ids from its crcampgn,
# crbd and crch .ini files). call2arm.bzn is the "Legacy Instant Action" addon
# map (mapType instant_action); swap in any Instant Action map the install has.
# multdm11.bzn is a stock deathmatch map from the game room's map list (not
# its default selection, so the map pick is exercised); mp_host needs the
# harness's NoAuthLan and Sync Join settings (Run-BZRModeStress.ps1 header).

shell 5
mission misn03cr.bzn 60 cr_campaign
shell 3
mission bd01cr.bzn 60 cr_blackdog
shell 3
ia call2arm.bzn 60
shell 3
mp_host multdm11.bzn 30
mission misn04cr.bzn 60 cr_campaign
shell 3
mp_host multdm11.bzn 30
mission ch01cr.bzn 60 cr_chinese
shell 5
loop 2
